    "description": "<p data-local-id=\"a14b5f4137d2\"><strong>Context</strong><br>Emily found she could enter a Deposit Date in the future, and that Signup Date was auto-populating from the SLC (Study Link Click) click date rather than the actual date the player signed up — both are data quality risks.</p><table data-local-id=\"59380397-08cc-4eb6-b819-8a680250e011\"><thead><tr><th data-local-id=\"27b4610bafba\"><p data-local-id=\"96827c42be0e\">Expected behaviour</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-local-id=\"2fbacea91331\"><p data-local-id=\"c2389c6d32ed\"><strong>Signup Date is the date the player actually signed up</strong>, taken from the proof the player sends, not from the SLC click date.</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"a3ba29879f86\"><p data-local-id=\"2184854d2494\"><strong>No future dates</strong> on Signup Date, Deposit Date or First Wager Date. The date must not be later than the date the user enters it.</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"c12f5855fdaf\"><p data-local-id=\"6968e09ad3c3\"><strong>Past dates are allowed</strong> on all three fields.</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"90bb405a2860\"><p data-local-id=\"08b314d0b636\"><strong>Deposit Date and First Wager Date must not be before Signup Date.</strong> Block the save, because a deposit or wager before signup is not possible.</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"655c212f1706\"><p data-local-id=\"0788124073d7\"><strong>All three dates can be the same day.</strong> Lina said this will be common.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-local-id=\"82b1ea8d844e\"><strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul data-local-id=\"84ae12b999d9\"><li data-local-id=\"a985602cce6c\"><p data-local-id=\"8d9b098f1ef2\">Remove the automatic pre-population of Signup Date from the SLC click date. Leave Signup Date blank by default so ops/reps enter the actual signup date.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"727078e8c77b\"><p data-local-id=\"2c887285a8c0\">Add validation: Signup Date, Deposit Date, and First Wager Date cannot be later than today&#039;s date (no future dates) on any of these three fields.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"1ebb24c4517d\"><p data-local-id=\"1a6978872425\">Add validation: Deposit Date and First Wager Date cannot be earlier than the Signup Date. Same calendar day is allowed for all three.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"696c3268da6c\"><p data-local-id=\"bd2d3db133bb\">The Date validations described above must apply when editing the Sign Up via the Record Page as well as via the Screenflows triggered by the Log Sign Up and Complete Sign Up buttons. </p></li><li data-local-id=\"e27d6f37745a\"><p data-local-id=\"15b292ab3b3e\">Validation above must not prevent user from saving the record with blank dates (except when Completing the Sign Up) </p></li></ul><p data-local-id=\"2e637d2ec88d\"><strong>Constraints / Dependencies</strong>\nNone called out.</p><p data-local-id=\"d6f97b3f9b2f\"><strong>Source</strong>\nFathom — WagerTech &lt;&gt; Jumpr Weekly Sync, 09/23/2026 (https://fathom.video/calls/831090060) — Emily Vandenberg ~29:28–32:27, Lina Ceniccola ~30:09–33:31, Kobi Kunasekaran ~31:27–32:15. Also Taryn&#039;s notes, Sign-ups &gt; &quot;log sign-up → Sign up date logic,&quot; &quot;validation not to push anything to FUTURE date,&quot; &quot;date logic w/ First wager.&quot;</p>",
